WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.180
-You need to prove you're looking for work

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.680
-Yeah I've been looking, trust me

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.020
-Three signatures by tomorrow 
or you can tell it to the judge

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.380
-Tell me about a time when you 
worked hard to solve a problem

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.860
-This morning, getting up

00:00:20.789 --> 00:00:22.880
-We're gonna find you someone you like

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.340
-Let me be your arms and your legs 
- I love that

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.520
-Alright

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.280
-Penthouse

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.460
-You need to wait your turn

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.240
-Relax. It's not a holdup. 
Just sign this for me please.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.000
- How would I sign it?
- I don't know. Slowly?

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.260
- Don't your arms work? 
- They don't.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.620
- You can move your mouth.
- As can you.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.100
- I need assistance.
- How much is the pay?

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.620
-Hell yeah man!

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.340
Hell yeah!

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.340
-It's my bad, 
my bad, man

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.360
-You are not qualified for this position

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.580
-The buckle! Buckle

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.820
- Have you ever changed a catheter? 
- Nah

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.500
-Pinch the head, insert.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.020
-I can't feel it.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.549
-Well, I can.

00:01:05.549 --> 00:01:08.600
-You wanna feed your soul? 
Then listen to what's cool.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:12.440
"Think, think, think about 
what you're trying to do to me"

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.520
-It's amazing ain't it? 
I sound just like her.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.920
-Yeah, it's uncanny.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.700
- You as rich is Jay-Z? 
- No, richer.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.960
- Which car is yours? 
- All of these to the right.

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.100
- Oh my God.
- They're not practical

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.220
-Exactly!

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:32.560
-Wooooooo!

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.440
-You can have any girl you want.
What about this lady with all the botox?

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.060
-You'll be perfect for each other.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.540
You can't move your body,
and she can't move her face.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:44.460
-Surprise!

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.540
-I specifically said nothing for my birthday.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.400
-I'm sorry you got to have a 
surprise party in your huge mansion.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.660
Someone's got real problems.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.460
- I'm fighting to see my son. 
- And whose fault is it?

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.940
Is it yours or is the world 
out to get you?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.380
-Are you mad? 
You wanna break this big-ass bottle of wine?

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.240
-Yes!

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:04.620
-What else you wanna do?
-The bull!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:08.360
-What–

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.260
-Dell made a mess

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:28.240
-Just relax!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:32.120
-I am relaxed!
This is me being relaxed!

